{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Science and Fiction (formerly known as Silence of the Siren) is a turn-based strategy game where several different space-faring civilizations fight over control of a distant star system. Explore what\u2019s left on the planets and secure resources to build mighty cities. Raise powerful armies and defeat your opponents on the battlefield!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access status</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Science and Fiction now contains 5 playable factions, three campaigns with 4 levels each and 20+ skirmish maps set in colorful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction brings its own base,  7 upgradeable unit types, a special skill and a set of commanders to choose from. There are 24 skills, 54 active commander abilities and various pieces of equipment, consumables and artifacts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/cfff793ff91a417f1a6b2c1a328b0c01.poster.avif?t=1771521001\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/cfff793ff91a417f1a6b2c1a328b0c01.webm?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/cfff793ff91a417f1a6b2c1a328b0c01.mp4?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/e9fa037ebd244081b229cbe514f748b2.webp?t=1771521001\" width=620 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Siren star system, birthplace of a galactic alliance, and the homeworld of a lost Primals civilization, has been cut from the rest of the galaxy. As a result, the carefully built alliance split into bickering factions and secluded colonies. These days, hardly anyone pays attention to the ruins scattered all over the few habitable planets of a freshly isolated system. The deeper you venture into the uncharted regions, the stronger the feeling of endangerment grows. There is something else. An entity, a shade, an echo of whispers from below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/492fc58eebd3e88ca06cd0207f44f125.poster.avif?t=1771521001\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/492fc58eebd3e88ca06cd0207f44f125.webm?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/492fc58eebd3e88ca06cd0207f44f125.mp4?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/55e2a53b931d53c556e53896d169f229.webp?t=1771521001\" width=620 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore what's left on the planets and secure important resources. Use them to upgrade your bases with advanced technology and to hire massive armies. Play as several different factions, recruit skilled commanders, teach them new skills and lead them into battle. Overcome obstacles on the map to gather powerful equipment and ancient artifacts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/8f70afa9e7e9a8d81323e9dff70fac44.poster.avif?t=1771521001\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/8f70afa9e7e9a8d81323e9dff70fac44.webm?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/8f70afa9e7e9a8d81323e9dff70fac44.mp4?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/9f7c53eafeee4d26b34d5083d9b8c273.webp?t=1771521001\" width=620 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide range of enemies in turn-based combat, use your tactical thinking to gain advantage on the battlefield. Learn the unique moves of your units, deploy your commander's special abilities and outsmart even much stronger opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/75e55252941d0643f9f7c76d3a212022.poster.avif?t=1771521001\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/75e55252941d0643f9f7c76d3a212022.webm?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/75e55252941d0643f9f7c76d3a212022.mp4?t=1771521001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147380/extras/dcf7c9bc438a8f4e0d36df4cd07e1324.webp?t=1771521001\" width=620 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a rich sci-fi world and discover secrets of a lost civilization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect powerful artifacts, secure important resources, upgrade your bases and hire the strongest units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level-up your commanders and crush your opponents in exciting turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take control over several different species and factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Old-school strategy game with modern controls and intuitive UI</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So it begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/2b600781aa74d5cd2715d04f8e8dcf0e96ad005d.jpg"},{"name":"One more turn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/840baee839aa405623905df2cd6ff07a00999d9b.jpg"},{"name":"Just my luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/9057bad3ac832de7012ffbaca17b50b06e0e7d68.jpg"},{"name":"Well, that is new!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/ad0bbf6d9e8a30d820df7171c95fb303d00b0885.jpg"},{"name":"Roberto the Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/f54b6d9911e1bcd8a02d801ee575d9e8b3d6956c.jpg"},{"name":"I will walk 500 000 tiles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/8dc3a95b19f560cfb8c320f2566ff2027b3c0c4a.jpg"},{"name":"Yucky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/baf8d9e935c1bc3656aa932ddfec0a5783927655.jpg"},{"name":"Shuffle them Commanders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/814c9b3c1c2405e707c7ef438b92434e886cf42a.jpg"},{"name":"Ohm nom nom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2147380/43e642b543a74db9a367fdef37093a4d708b74af.jpg"},{"name":"Well Guarded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam